</svg>
::end

::paragraph id=virtual-check-missing
A document that cannot be found is an error saying what to run — never an empty one. `dx sync` reconciles the rest: it adopts plain-text files anything else wrote, restores documents from the packs when the index is missing, and reports what it cannot resolve rather than discarding it.
::end

::checklist id=virtual-check-list
[x] Every read routes through the store rather than the file
[x] A missing document names the command that repairs it
[x] Resolving creates nothing — reading never writes
[ ] Re-check after any change to the pack format
::end
